From: "Sgt.Bilko" <59089219+SgtBilko76@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:16:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/44] RRV bridge 0004-gif-packed-partial-exhaustion

Fukami tools/patches/pcsx2/0004-gif-packed-partial-exhaustion.patch, applied to ARMSX2 by a clean three-way merge.
---
 pcsx2/GS/GSState.cpp | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/pcsx2/GS/GSState.cpp b/pcsx2/GS/GSState.cpp
index d0058de68f..7b73546a13 100644
--- a/pcsx2/GS/GSState.cpp
+++ b/pcsx2/GS/GSState.cpp
@@ -5003,6 +5003,14 @@ void GSState::Transfer(const u8* mem, u32 size)
 							break;
 					}
 
+					// A split path-3 PACKED payload can finish the current loop while retaining
+					// a residual QWC for the next GIFtag. Do not enter PACKED fallback here.
+					if constexpr (index == 3)
+					{
+						if (size == 0 || path.nloop == 0)
+							break;
+					}
+
 					// all data available? usually is
 
 					total = path.nloop * path.nreg;
